{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9fd1bd7ca26b13b2","name":"Centurion-Class Battlecruiser","source":{"id":"source:reference-9fd1bd7ca26b13b2","title":"Centurion-Class Battlecruiser","revision":19073,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:15:44Z","sha256":"e595c30cbe4b37310ce04ed8469e52cca502aef19c0996011538a2aa036df820","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19073","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Centurion-Class%20Battlecruiser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9fd1bd7ca26b13b2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Twice the size of ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Interdictor"]},"-Class Cruisers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Interdictor-Class_Cruisers"},", the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Centurion"]},"-Class Battlecruiser is the heavyweight of Revan's Fleet, first fighting for the Republic, then against it. Intended to phase out the problematic ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Inexpugnable"]},"-Class Tactical Command Vessels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inexpugnable-Class_Tactical_Command_Vessels"},", a limited number of these 1,200-meter-long Starships see action in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},". Several of the ships are crushed beyond recognition by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mass Shadow Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mass_Shadow_Generator"}," in the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". The rest wind up serving as prestigious, colossal mobile fortresses for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Centurion"]},"-Class Battlecruiser is a powerful ship that presents an intimidating visage to its opponents. Built in the same wedge-shaped design that would later become popular among ",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Destroyers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Destroyers"}," in the Galactic Civil War, a single ",{"tag":"i","children":["Centurion"]},"-Class Battlecruiser packs enough firepower to take on an ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Inexpugnable"]},"-Class Tactical Command Vessel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inexpugnable-Class_Tactical_Command_Vessel","referenceId":"reference:d59aa3231457187f"}," and is purely a weapon of war.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most ",{"tag":"i","children":["Centurion"]},"-Class Battlecruisers are destroyed or captured by the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"},". However, during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Wars"},", the Sith Lord ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Nihilus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Nihilus","referenceId":"reference:0f4fcd6fb21229ce"}," manages to resurrect one of the crushed Battlecruisers from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},", turning the wreck of The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ravager"]}," into a spaceworthy ghost ship.\n"]},"\n",{"t